; Import definitions for the Win32 APIs WinCLI implements.
; Used by guests/build.sh to generate kernel32.lib via rust-lld.
; Keep in sync with `pe::SUPPORTED_APIS` in src/pe/mod.rs.
LIBRARY KERNEL32
EXPORTS
GetStdHandle
WriteFile
ExitProcess
CreateFileW
ReadFile
CloseHandle
CreateDirectoryW
RemoveDirectoryW
DeleteFileW
MoveFileW
CopyFileW
GetCommandLineW
GetCommandLineA
GetConsoleMode
SetConsoleMode
WriteConsoleW
GetConsoleOutputCP
SetConsoleTextAttribute
ReadConsoleW
